# The pictures of appearance.md: a cylinder extruded from a circle, its
# appearance set to metal on its group's screen, and shading by
# appearance turned on in the preferences.
cursor on
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 340 300
down L 340 300
up L 340 300
key esc
key x shift
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
cursor off
shot appearance-1-shaft
cursor on
twmove 433 245
mark 405 240 75 22 tw
shot appearance-2-metal tw
twdown L 433 245
twup L 433 245
# A bronze colour, so that the metal's highlight shows.
twmove 340 265
twdown L 340 265
twup L 340 265
edit 0.8, 0.55, 0.25
menu Edit|Preferences...
# Down to the row "shade solids by their appearance".
twscroll 300 300 -9.7
twmove 37 211
mark 14 201 330 22 tw
shot appearance-3-shade tw
twdown L 37 211
twup L 37 211
cursor off
shot appearance-4-shaded gw
